Thermal Observatory

Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs.

Thermal Observatory is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for making thermal behaviour in a
data centre a first-class, replayable, provenance-aware system record with explicit headroom,
hotspot, coupling, derating and attribution evidence.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Thermal Observatory does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All records are written to local
files chosen by the operator and never leave the machine running the software. The runtime opens no
network socket, no device, no driver and no privileged API.

Thermal Observatory accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
